---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro"
import Prose from "@/components/typography/Prose.astro"
import VideoModal from "@/components/concerts/VideoModal.astro"
import VideoThumbnail from "@/components/concerts/VideoThumbnail.astro"
import office from "@/assets/images/dp-office.jpg"
import townHall from "@/assets/images/dp-town-hall.jpg"

const townHallCaption = "Group photo after my first Monthly Town Hall meeting in Digital Pathshala"
const officeCaption = "Rupesh dai on the left, Sanjeev dai and Umesh dai on the top right"
const coffeeCaption = "Raghav dai preparing special coffee for Mausam dai, Pranjal dai and me"
const coffeeVideo = "https://2iw0lwaklqgp6qdp.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/dp/VID_20251016_093545_552-0HuWPeInV0mQmX5ZNFaxtOA6nGrSyL.mp4"
---

<PageLayout
  heading="Digital Pathshala"
  intro="My MERN stack internship in Itahari, from September 2025."
 
  description="Manish Tamang's MERN stack internship at Digital Pathshala, Itahari."
>
  <Prose class="max-w-none">
    <p>
      My journey with Digital Pathshala (DP) is something I'll always be proud of. Located at the heart of Itahari, DP
      is not just one of the biggest IT companies and institutes in the city, but also a place where I truly began my
      professional growth.
    </p>
    <p>
      While I was pursuing my +2 in Itahari, I got the opportunity to work as a MERN stack intern at DP. I joined on
      September 29, 2025, and from day one, I was exposed to real-world projects. It wasn't just about coding, it was
      about learning how things actually work in a professional environment. I built connections, collaborated with
      talented developers, and became part of a growing tech community in my own city.
    </p>
    <figure>
      <Image
        src={office}
        alt="Developers working at laptops and a large monitor in the Digital Pathshala office"
        widths={[480, 720, 1080, 1440]}
        sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 720px"
        quality={75}
        class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border"
      />
      <figcaption>{officeCaption}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p>
      The people at DP made the experience even more special. CEO Manish Basnet sir is incredibly humble and treats
      everyone equally, always spreading positivity throughout the office. My brother, Rupesh Chaudary, who introduced
      me to DP, is a versatile full-stack developer with strong backend expertise. Working alongside him and others was
      inspiring.
    </p>
    <p>
      I had the chance to collaborate with Umesh Mehta on projects like “UpaayaX” and “HamroTask,” which were valuable
      learning experiences for me. Ramesh Adhikari, the CTO at the time, played a big role in making the workplace feel
      welcoming. Some of my favorite memories are the late evenings after work, heading home together with Ramesh dai
      and Manish sir after long but fulfilling days.
    </p>
    <p>
      My internship schedule itself was a challenge I'm proud of, attending college during the day and then working
      from 5:30 PM to 10:30 PM. It was tiring, but every moment was worth it.
    </p>
    <!-- Before the paragraph, so the text wraps around it -->
    <figure class="float-right mt-1 mb-2 ml-4 w-36 sm:ml-6 sm:w-52">
      <VideoThumbnail src={coffeeVideo} label={coffeeCaption} caption={`${coffeeCaption}, Oct 16, 2025`} tall />
    </figure>
    <p>
      Then there were the small but meaningful moments, coffee breaks with Raghav dai and Mausam dai. Mausam Gurung, the
      UI/UX Head, added a creative energy to the team that made collaboration even more enjoyable.
    </p>
    <p>
      The environment at DP never felt like a typical office. It felt more like a second home. From the friendly
      atmosphere to the monthly town hall meetings on the first day of each month, everything contributed to a sense of
      belonging.
    </p>
    <figure class="clear-both">
      <Image
        src={townHall}
        alt={townHallCaption}
        widths={[480, 720, 1080, 1440]}
        sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 720px"
        quality={75}
        class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border"
      />
      <figcaption>{townHallCaption}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <blockquote>
      One of the proudest moments of my journey was being awarded <mark>“Best Intern of the Month.”</mark> It was a small
      recognition, but it meant a lot to me and reflected the growth I experienced there.
    </blockquote>
    <p>
      Digital Pathshala wasn't just a workplace for me, it was where I grew, learned, and built memories that I'll carry
      forward in my journey as a developer.
    </p>
  </Prose>
  <VideoModal />
</PageLayout>
